```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>CSS創意圖：生日蛋糕</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: lightblue;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h2 {
            color: deeppink;
        }

        /* 蠟燭 */
        #candle1 {
            width: 10px;
            height: 50px;
            background-color: lightyellow;
            border: 2px solid orange;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* 火焰 */
        #fire {
            width: 15px;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: orange;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* 蛋糕最上層 */
        #cake1 {
            width: 120px;
            height: 40px;
            background-color: pink;
            border: 2px solid deeppink;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* 蛋糕中間層 */
        #cake2 {
            width: 180px;
            height: 50px;
            background-color: lightpink;
            border: 2px solid deeppink;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* 蛋糕底層 */
        #cake3 {
            width: 240px;
            height: 60px;
            background-color: hotpink;
            border: 2px solid deeppink;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* 蛋糕盤 */
        #plate {
            width: 280px;
            height: 15px;
            background-color: silver;
            border: 2px solid gray;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: auto;
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h2>🎂 生日快樂 🎂</h2>

    <div id="fire"></div>
    <div id="candle1"></div>

    <div id="cake1"></div>
    <div id="cake2"></div>
    <div id="cake3"></div>

    <div id="plate"></div>

</body>
</html>
```
